# Skill and agent references

Reference skills and agents **by name only** (e.g. **commit-formatting**, **implementer-v2**, **pr-reviewer-high-level**).

Do **not** hardcode:

- Filesystem paths to skills or agents
- Harness-specific roots (`.cursor/`, `.agent/`, `~/.cursor/skills/`, etc.)
- Slash-command skill invocations (`/commit-formatting`)
- Harness-specific frontmatter (`model`, `allowed-tools`, `disable-model-invocation`, etc.) — keep only portable `name` and `description` fields

Each harness resolves names to its own skill and agent locations, and applies its own model, tool, and invocation settings.
